flowchart TD
  Coord[Owner-approved 0190 priority\nPR #82 holds existing physical claim\nPhase 2B number remains unassigned]
  G1A[G1-A: closed V1 vectors\nrecovery + lock + reservation]
  G1B[G1-B: provider-free schema/synthetic gate]
  G1C[G1-C: protected custody gate]
  G1D[G1-D: human disposition gate]
  G1E[G1-E: response-backed UI gate]
  Pilot[G1-F: separate provider pilot gate]

  C1[2B-1 documentation/vectors only\nrecords coordination — no DDL]
  C2[2B-2 private authority/receipt schema\nrequires fresh approved allocation]
  C3[2B-3 provider-free deterministic simulator]
  C4[2B-4 protected candidate custody]
  C5[2B-5 direct-human reviewed CRM effect]
  C6[2B-6 Integration Review UI]

  Coord --> C1
  G1A --> C1
  C1 --> C2
  G1B --> C2
  C2 --> C3
  G1B --> C3
  C3 --> C4
  G1C --> C4
  C4 --> C5
  G1D --> C5
  C5 --> C6
  G1E --> C6
  C6 --> Pilot

  subgraph Ingress[Boundary A — provider-neutral / no CRM effect]
    Verify[Fixed endpoint + eligible signing generation\nraw bytes verified before parse]
    Receipt[Reserve canonical event receipt\nidentity + versioned digest]
    Classify[Classify reserved receipt\nidentity + versioned digest]
    ReplayReturn[Same identity + same digest\nreturn original durable result\nSTOP — no reroute/new outcome]
    ConflictStop[Same identity + conflicting digest\nimmutable IDENTITY_CONFLICT\nSTOP — fail closed]
    EvidenceReconcile[Durable evidence unavailable/ambiguous\nreconciliation required\nSTOP — no fresh identity/CRM effect]
    Route[Historical source asset → connection → grant → mapping]
    Cutover[Trusted contiguous cutover:\nt less than T → A; t = T → B\ngaps / overlaps / untrusted time fail closed]
    Durable[Commit receipt state + bounded outcome\neligible route: ROUTED_TO_REVIEW]
    Ack[Only then synthetic adapter acknowledgement]
    Verify --> Receipt --> Classify
    Classify -->|new verified event| Route --> Cutover --> Durable --> Ack
    Classify -->|same identity + same digest| ReplayReturn
    Classify -->|same identity + conflicting digest| ConflictStop
    Classify -->|unavailable / ambiguous durable evidence| EvidenceReconcile
  end

  subgraph Review[Boundary B — direct-human only]
    ReadAuth[Same human + frozen school\ncurrent result-read authorization]
    Reconcile[Reconcile original durable K\nunchanged fingerprint/capsule]
    ResultStop[Committed K: return scoped result\nSTOP — zero new writes]
    Conceal[Read denied or scoped receipt unavailable\nconceal/deny — STOP]
    FreshGate[Proven no durable K result\ncurrent decide/create/entitlement\nversion + effect + post-wait checks]
    FreshStop[Fresh gate denied/drift\nSTOP — zero new writes]
    Atomic[One atomic decision + case closure\nunique source-occurrence effect\ncanonical lead + provenance/result\naudit + structurally inert evidence]
    ReadAuth --> Reconcile
    Reconcile -->|committed durable result| ResultStop
    Reconcile -->|read denied / unavailable| Conceal
    Reconcile -->|proven no durable K result| FreshGate
    FreshGate -->|approved| Atomic
    FreshGate -->|denied / drift| FreshStop
  end

  C3 -. provider-free evidence only .-> Ingress
  C5 -. future approved backend proof .-> Review
  Durable -. no candidate / provider / CRM effect .-> Hold[Fail closed until later approved slice]

